Package: symbolizer
Title: Structured Symbolic Specifications, Interpretations, and Teachable Stories for Modern Statistical Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shinichi", "Nakagawa", email = "itchyshin@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7765-5182"))
  )
Description: Turns fitted distributional, multivariate, latent-variable, and
    spatial regression models into structured symbolic specifications that
    render as publication-ready LaTeX equations, assumption tables, formula
    bridges, parameter interpretations, and (later) structural model
    comparisons, methods text, simulation recipes, and model graphs.
    Companion to 'drmTMB' and 'gllvmTMB'; complementary to 'equatiomatic'
    for one-formula models.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://itchyshin.github.io/symbolizer/, https://github.com/itchyshin/symbolizer
